      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Probably less creator economy and more of a third party casualty to the battle between VRChat and avatar rippers. \n\nWere these programs that ran on people's computers, or more of a web service?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
