  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-07-28T14:11:05.248Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I learned recently that before I even started using VRChat, the tools third3d and avatown were a thing. VRChat decided that these extremely useful tools didn't match the creator economy vision and took them down without implementing the functionality those tools provided into their own software such as being able to upload an avatar to VRChat without even needing Unity, or doing custom work (retexturing for example) for someone, sending that file to them and letting them upload that file in one click. My feature suggestion is that the functionality these tools provided be implemented by VRChat as QoL updates.",
